<text><body>
<div type="detail"><p>Golden Fleece Alley is located between Russell and Exhibition streets. It extends west from Coverlid Place and doglegs to the north to a dead-end. It was named prior to 1895 for the Golden Fleece Hotel, on the corner of Russell Street and Golden Fleece Alley.</p></div>
</body>
